Create a program that computes and shows the perimeter and the area of a Right Triangle with a given base,height and hypotenuse. Name the class as RightTriangle. Show the appropriate algorithm.

Take note that a right triangle has a base and a height. The perimeter of a right triangle is base + height + hypotenuse. The theoretical formula for computing the area of a right triangle is (1/2) * base * height. 

Save the source code in the appropriate location.

------------------------------------------------------------------

Input: base, height and hypotenuse of a right triangle (base, height, hypotenuse)
Processes:  Compute the perimeter of the right triangle
            Compute the area of the right triangle
Display results
Output: perimeter, area

------------------------------------------------------------------

Algorithm:
1. Assign the side of the right triangle
2. Compute the perimeter : perimeter = base + height + hypotenuse
3. Compute the area: area = (1/2) * base * height
4. Show the side of the right triangle
5. Show the perimeter of the right triangle
6. Show the area of the right triangle

-------------------------------------------------------------------
*/

public class RightTriangle {
    public static void main(String [] args) {
        int base;
        int height;
        int hypotenuse;
        double perimeter;
        double areaOfRightTriangle;

        base = 3;
        height = 4;
        hypotenuse = 5;
        perimeter = base + height + hypotenuse;
        areaOfRightTriangle = (1/2) * base * height;

        System.out.println("");
        System.out.println("");
        System.out.println("**************************************************************");
        System.out.println("*                                                            *");
        System.out.println("*                                                            *");

        // Dimensions of the right triangle
        System.out.println("*  The dimensions of the right triangle are the following:   *");
        System.out.println("*                          base = " + base +"                          *");
        System.out.println("*                         height = " + height +"                         *");
        System.out.println("*                       hypotenuse = " + hypotenuse +"                       *");
        System.out.println("*                                                            *");

        //Computation of the Perimeter of the right triangle
        System.out.println("*         Perimeter of the right triangle is " + perimeter + "            *");

        //Computation of the Area of the right triangle
        System.out.println("*             Area of the right triangle is " + areaOfRightTriangle + "              *");

        System.out.println("*                                                            *");
        System.out.println("*                                                            *");
        System.out.println("**************************************************************");
    }
}
